{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"He has a smile at the mimicry. \"It's better like this. I really do like the name.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:29:38.528000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739324003994435636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"\"Oh I live around wherever is comfortable. Jackalope tend to wander but i enjoy when colonisers come through. Sparks a lot of entertainment.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:31:01.386000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739324351526076556","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"“Are there others here - natives, not colonizers?”","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:31:27.858000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739324462557822997","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"739055468848218132","content":"\"All kinds, you're the ones coming to build on our lands. Quite the history really.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:32:22.244000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739324690668978226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
